# into this file.
# Split 2026-11-13 (0.4.0 route audit, Refs #2025): this guide is the Badlands loop, ending in Thelsamar with Ghak
# Healtouch's hand-in; Desolace's south loop that used to follow it is 30-40/06b-desolace, the default next guide.
# The Riverglades come later in the route (40-50/01b-riverglades, after Stranglethorn Vale), at the level of their port
# and Western Front.
# Level tidy (0.4.0): Scrounging's scrap (733) comes from the Dustbelcher Ogres (38-39) west of Agmond's End, away from the
# Maulers and Shamans (41-43) further south-west; Lotwil's last test, the Bracers of Rock Binding (712, Greater Rock
# Elementals 42-44), is left out of the solo route, and with it Lucien Tosselwrench's trade (716), which needs it.
# Safety Checks (97617): Dorgaron gives it at the foot of the pass; the artifacts and the helmet come from the Shadowforge
# diggers and the Stonevault Bonesnappers this guide already fights, and the Pristine Mattock, which lies among Agmond's
# End's Stonevault Shamans (40-41) beside Murdaloc (42), waits for 40-50/02-badlands, which hands it in on its way north.

